{"id":"6.3","title":"Hva gjorde du i fritida i hjemlandet?","audio":"audio/6.3.mp3","duration":152.83,"synthetic":false,"sentences":[{"id":0,"start":0.15,"end":6.17,"text":"6.3 Hva gjorde du i fritida i hjemlandet?","heading":true,"zh":"6.3 你在祖国时空闲时间做什么？","words":[[0,3,0.15,1.53,"6.3"],[4,7,2.78,3.46,"hva"],[8,14,3.46,3.96,"gjorde"],[15,17,3.96,4.2,"du"],[18,19,4.2,4.4,"i"],[20,27,4.4,5.0,"fritida"],[28,29,5.0,5.34,"i"],[30,40,5.34,6.09,"hjemlandet"]]},{"id":1,"start":9.6,"end":20.1,"text":"I fritida var jeg ofte ute og danset med venner, eller vi gikk på konsert. Jeg spilte også volleyball, og noen ganger gikk jeg på shopping med venninner.","speaker":"Viola","zh":"空闲时我常和朋友们出去跳舞，或者我们去听音乐会。我还打排球，有时候和女性朋友们去逛街购物。","words":[[0,1,9.68,9.82,"i"],[2,9,9.82,10.4,"fritida"],[10,13,10.4,10.62,"var"],[14,17,10.62,10.7,"jeg"],[18,22,10.7,11.02,"ofte"],[23,26,11.02,11.32,"ute"],[27,29,11.32,11.42,"og"],[30,36,11.42,11.9,"danset"],[37,40,11.9,12.08,"med"],[41,47,12.08,12.42,"venner"],[49,54,12.94,13.24,"eller"],[55,57,13.24,13.62,"vi"],[58,62,13.62,13.74,"gikk"],[63,65,13.74,13.88,"på~738db97cac32"],[66,73,13.88,14.38,"konsert"],[75,78,15.57,15.79,"jeg"],[79,85,15.79,16.09,"spilte"],[86,90,16.09,16.31,"også"],[91,101,16.31,16.87,"volleyball"],[103,105,17.43,17.59,"og"],[106,110,17.59,17.83,"noen~c766e2ef794d"],[111,117,17.83,18.19,"ganger"],[118,122,18.19,18.61,"gikk"],[123,126,18.61,18.71,"jeg"],[127,129,18.71,18.83,"på~443011216d88"],[130,138,18.83,19.13,"shopping"],[139,142,19.13,19.41,"med"],[143,152,19.41,20.02,"venninner"]]},{"id":2,"start":24.14,"end":41.87,"text":"I Polen trente jeg på treningssenter tre ganger i uka sammen med venner. Vi pleide også å gå på fotballkamp. Nå ser jeg bare fotball på tv, og jeg trener alltid alene.","speaker":"Marek","zh":"在波兰时，我每周和朋友们去健身房锻炼三次。我们还常去看足球赛。现在我只在电视上看足球，而且总是一个人锻炼。","words":[[0,1,24.23,24.35,"i"],[2,7,24.35,25.11,"polen~488e57c60a08"],[8,14,25.27,25.59,"trente"],[15,18,25.59,25.93,"jeg"],[19,21,26.15,26.27,"på"],[22,36,26.27,27.29,"treningssenter"],[37,40,27.61,28.05,"tre"],[41,47,28.05,28.37,"ganger"],[48,49,28.37,28.87,"i~82e4f1cd42dc"],[50,53,28.87,29.27,"uka"],[54,60,29.67,30.03,"sammen"],[61,64,30.03,30.19,"med"],[65,71,30.19,30.53,"venner"],[73,75,32.66,32.92,"vi"],[76,82,32.92,33.28,"pleide"],[83,87,33.28,33.66,"også"],[88,89,33.66,34.18,"å~0583da7a620a"],[90,92,34.18,34.32,"gå"],[93,95,34.32,34.52,"på~af536c349e1a"],[96,107,34.52,35.28,"fotballkamp"],[109,111,36.49,37.05,"nå~d531d47a7712"],[112,115,37.05,37.63,"ser"],[116,119,37.63,37.79,"jeg"],[120,124,37.79,37.99,"bare"],[125,132,37.99,38.55,"fotball"],[133,135,38.55,38.75,"på"],[136,138,38.75,39.07,"tv"],[140,142,39.48,39.86,"og"],[143,146,39.86,40.0,"jeg"],[147,153,40.0,40.44,"trener~08cfad369757"],[154,160,40.44,40.98,"alltid~867f85a8b647"],[161,166,40.98,41.79,"alene"]]},{"id":3,"start":46.16,"end":55.02,"text":"Jeg inviterte ofte venner hjem til meg. Jeg bodde i en stor by, og vi pleide å gå på diskotek i helgene.","speaker":"Sompit","zh":"我经常请朋友到我家来。我住在一个大城市，周末我们常去迪厅。","words":[[0,3,46.24,46.5,"jeg"],[4,13,46.5,47.22,"inviterte"],[14,18,47.22,47.82,"ofte"],[19,25,47.82,48.4,"venner"],[26,30,48.4,48.68,"hjem~e7045642e9ab"],[31,34,48.68,48.88,"til"],[35,38,48.88,49.06,"meg"],[40,43,49.8,50.52,"jeg"],[44,49,50.52,50.84,"bodde"],[50,51,50.84,50.98,"i"],[52,54,50.98,51.14,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[55,59,51.14,51.5,"stor"],[60,62,51.5,51.84,"by"],[64,66,52.48,52.56,"og"],[67,69,52.56,52.68,"vi"],[70,76,52.68,53.04,"pleide"],[77,78,53.04,53.24,"å~0583da7a620a"],[79,81,53.24,53.36,"gå"],[82,84,53.36,53.5,"på~cbd02572c370"],[85,93,53.5,54.22,"diskotek"],[94,95,54.22,54.42,"i~898371af17e5"],[96,103,54.42,54.94,"helgene"]]},{"id":4,"start":58.91,"end":75.22,"text":"Jeg laget ofte mat i hjemlandet. Mamma lærte meg mye. Jeg likte å lage mat sammen med henne. Jeg var mye sammen med venninner, og vi skravlet og sang. Av og til var vi på fester og danset.","speaker":"Hawa","zh":"在祖国时我经常做饭。妈妈教了我很多。我喜欢和她一起做饭。我常和女性朋友们在一起，我们聊天、唱歌。有时候我们去参加聚会、跳舞。","words":[[0,3,58.99,59.31,"jeg"],[4,9,59.31,59.71,"laget~8790a82fb4ba"],[10,14,59.71,60.17,"ofte"],[15,18,60.17,60.47,"mat"],[19,20,60.47,60.79,"i"],[21,31,60.79,61.39,"hjemlandet"],[33,38,62.21,62.75,"mamma"],[39,44,62.75,63.15,"lærte~a76f12f208de"],[45,48,63.15,63.31,"meg"],[49,52,63.31,63.69,"mye~cc164d0dc3da"],[54,57,64.49,64.83,"jeg"],[58,63,64.83,65.15,"likte"],[64,65,65.15,65.25,"å~0583da7a620a"],[66,70,65.25,65.47,"lage"],[71,74,65.47,65.81,"mat"],[75,81,65.81,66.21,"sammen"],[82,85,66.21,66.31,"med"],[86,91,66.31,66.53,"henne"],[93,96,67.8,68.12,"jeg"],[97,100,68.12,68.28,"var"],[101,104,68.28,68.56,"mye~933c5a923198"],[105,111,68.56,68.98,"sammen"],[112,115,68.98,69.1,"med"],[116,125,69.1,69.54,"venninner"],[127,129,69.84,70.08,"og"],[130,132,70.08,70.22,"vi"],[133,141,70.22,70.78,"skravlet"],[142,144,70.78,70.98,"og"],[145,149,70.98,71.32,"sang"],[151,153,72.35,72.65,"av~26a687fec87a"],[154,156,72.65,72.75,"og"],[157,160,72.75,72.99,"til~69fe6862a430"],[161,164,72.99,73.49,"var"],[165,167,73.49,73.63,"vi"],[168,170,73.63,73.77,"på"],[171,177,73.77,74.25,"fester"],[178,180,74.25,74.51,"og"],[181,187,74.51,75.14,"danset"]]},{"id":5,"start":77.34,"end":93.12,"text":"Jeg hadde ikke mye fritid i hjemlandet. Jeg jobbet nesten hele tida, men av og til spilte jeg kort med venner. I helgene pleide vi å dra på piknik med barna.","speaker":"Yousef","zh":"在祖国时我没有多少空闲时间。我几乎一直在工作，不过有时会和朋友们打牌。周末我们常带孩子们去野餐。","words":[[0,3,78.88,79.68,"jeg"],[4,9,79.68,80.12,"hadde"],[10,14,80.12,80.34,"ikke"],[15,18,80.34,80.64,"mye~cc164d0dc3da"],[19,25,80.64,81.2,"fritid"],[26,27,81.2,81.42,"i"],[28,38,81.42,82.0,"hjemlandet"],[40,43,82.84,83.12,"jeg"],[44,50,83.12,83.52,"jobbet"],[51,57,83.52,83.96,"nesten"],[58,62,83.96,84.24,"hele"],[63,67,84.24,84.58,"tida"],[69,72,85.54,85.82,"men"],[73,75,85.82,86.3,"av~26a687fec87a"],[76,78,86.3,86.42,"og"],[79,82,86.42,86.42,"til~69fe6862a430"],[83,89,86.42,87.22,"spilte"],[90,93,87.22,87.38,"jeg"],[94,98,87.38,87.68,"kort~4b3edda54db4"],[99,102,87.68,88.08,"med"],[103,109,88.08,88.4,"venner"],[111,112,89.62,89.92,"i~898371af17e5"],[113,120,89.92,90.48,"helgene"],[121,127,90.48,91.16,"pleide"],[128,130,91.16,91.28,"vi"],[131,132,91.28,91.42,"å~0583da7a620a"],[133,136,91.42,91.58,"dra"],[137,139,91.58,91.72,"på~b4c6c2ee8434"],[140,146,91.72,92.2,"piknik"],[147,150,92.2,92.56,"med"],[151,156,92.56,93.04,"barna"]]},{"id":6,"start":97.2,"end":109.05,"text":"Jeg spilte ofte fotball med venner i hjemlandet. Vi pleide også å gå på kino. Noen ganger dro vi til sjøen og koste oss på stranda.","speaker":"Biniam","zh":"在祖国时我经常和朋友们踢足球。我们以前也常去看电影。有时我们去海边，在海滩上玩得很开心。","words":[[0,3,97.28,97.65,"jeg"],[4,10,97.65,98.11,"spilte"],[11,15,98.11,98.47,"ofte"],[16,23,98.47,99.05,"fotball"],[24,27,99.05,99.43,"med"],[28,34,99.43,99.85,"venner"],[35,36,99.85,100.03,"i"],[37,47,100.03,100.61,"hjemlandet"],[49,51,101.43,101.93,"vi"],[52,58,101.93,102.29,"pleide"],[59,63,102.29,102.69,"også"],[64,65,102.69,102.89,"å~0583da7a620a"],[66,68,102.89,103.03,"gå"],[69,71,103.03,103.19,"på~c0dfbb17841e"],[72,76,103.19,103.61,"kino"],[78,82,104.82,105.46,"noen~c766e2ef794d"],[83,89,105.46,105.9,"ganger"],[90,93,105.9,106.34,"dro"],[94,96,106.34,106.52,"vi"],[97,100,106.52,106.7,"til"],[101,106,106.7,107.26,"sjøen"],[107,109,107.26,107.5,"og"],[110,115,107.5,108.06,"koste"],[116,119,108.06,108.24,"oss"],[120,122,108.24,108.42,"på"],[123,130,108.42,108.97,"stranda"]]},{"id":7,"start":112.18,"end":114.35,"text":"Hva gjorde de i fritida?","zh":"他们空闲时做了什么？","words":[[0,3,112.26,112.62,"hva"],[4,10,112.62,113.04,"gjorde"],[11,13,113.04,113.38,"de"],[14,15,113.38,113.64,"i"],[16,23,113.64,114.27,"fritida"]]},{"id":8,"start":116.07,"end":117.56,"text":"De danset sammen.","zh":"他们一起跳舞。","words":[[0,2,116.15,116.34,"de"],[3,9,116.34,116.92,"danset"],[10,16,116.92,117.48,"sammen"]]},{"id":9,"start":119.5,"end":120.5,"text":"De spilte sjakk.","zh":"他们下国际象棋。","words":[[0,2,119.58,119.71,"de"],[3,9,119.71,120.15,"spilte"],[10,15,120.15,120.42,"sjakk"]]},{"id":10,"start":122.86,"end":124.43,"text":"Hun jobbet i hagen.","zh":"她在花园里干活。","words":[[0,3,122.94,123.15,"hun"],[4,10,123.15,123.61,"jobbet"],[11,12,123.61,123.75,"i"],[13,18,123.75,124.35,"hagen"]]},{"id":11,"start":126.04,"end":128.68,"text":"De trente på treningssenter.","zh":"他们在健身房锻炼。","words":[[0,2,126.12,126.26,"de"],[3,9,126.26,126.94,"trente"],[10,12,126.94,127.46,"på"],[13,27,127.46,128.6,"treningssenter"]]},{"id":12,"start":130.65,"end":132.22,"text":"De spilte dataspill.","zh":"他们玩电脑游戏。","words":[[0,2,130.73,130.89,"de"],[3,9,130.89,131.33,"spilte"],[10,19,131.33,132.14,"dataspill"]]},{"id":13,"start":134.53,"end":136.66,"text":"Jenta var på fisketur.","zh":"女孩去钓鱼了。","words":[[0,5,134.61,135.18,"jenta"],[6,9,135.18,135.44,"var"],[10,12,135.44,135.7,"på"],[13,21,135.7,136.58,"fisketur"]]},{"id":14,"start":139.16,"end":141.33,"text":"Familien var på piknik.","zh":"一家人去野餐了。","words":[[0,8,139.24,139.99,"familien"],[9,12,139.99,140.23,"var"],[13,15,140.23,140.47,"på"],[16,22,140.47,141.25,"piknik"]]},{"id":15,"start":143.46,"end":145.3,"text":"Jentene strikket.","zh":"女孩们在织毛线。","words":[[0,7,143.54,144.23,"jentene"],[8,16,144.23,145.22,"strikket"]]},{"id":16,"start":146.83,"end":148.04,"text":"De spilte kort.","zh":"他们在打牌。","words":[[0,2,146.91,147.17,"de"],[3,9,147.17,147.73,"spilte"],[10,14,147.73,147.97,"kort~4b3edda54db4"]]}],"lexicon":{"6.3":{"lemma":"6.3","zh":"第 6.3 节","pos":"编号","ref":null,"clip":null,"kind":"section"},"alene":{"lemma":"alene","zh":"独自一人","pos":"副词","ref":"2-054","clip":"pronunciation/3c24fdbe3fdf986a62b0.mp3"},"alltid":{"lemma":"alltid","zh":"总是；一直","pos":"副词","ref":"basics:frequency:alltid","clip":"pronunciation/fca234bf04bff719be01.mp3"},"av":{"lemma":"av","zh":"……的；从；由","pos":"介词","ref":"pa-vei-3-029","clip":"pronunciation/27a26bca625b22397190.mp3"},"bare":{"lemma":"bare","zh":"只；仅仅；就","pos":"副词","ref":"basics:frequency:bare","clip":"pronunciation/9b828d53402d6e332ef0.mp3"},"barna":{"lemma":"barn","zh":"孩子","pos":"名词","ref":"ba